TC05 - Verify External GitHub Repository Link

Test Steps
Step	Action	Expected Result
1	Open https://playwright.dev/	Playwright homepage is displayed successfully.
2	Locate the GitHub icon/link in the navigation bar.	GitHub link is visible in the navigation bar.
3	Click the GitHub icon/link.	A new browser tab opens (external navigation).
4	Verify the new tab's URL matches "https://github.com/microsoft/playwright".	URL matches the expected GitHub repository address.
5	Verify the new tab's page title contains "playwright".	Correct GitHub repository page is loaded.
6	Verify the repository page displays the star count element.	Star count/button is visible on the GitHub page.
7	Close the new tab and switch back to the original Playwright homepage tab.	Original homepage tab is active and unaffected.

Expected Final Result
The user successfully opens the Playwright GitHub repository via the external navigation link in a new tab, confirms it loads the correct repository, and can return to the original homepage tab without disruption.